        <mxCell id="ow-rule" value="&lt;b&gt;The one rule that matters:&lt;/b&gt; the frontend must always echo back the formStatus returned by the last response. Rebuilding it from scratch silently drops keys that other screens — and the xAPI — put in the bag. All five section markers are xAPI-owned; the frontend creates none of them." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0F0F0;strokeColor=#5A5A5A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1F2124;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
